<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Bidders for S.Africa's Sun Air known next week.</title>
<headline>Bidders for S.Africa's Sun Air known next week.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pre-qualifiers for bids to buy South Africa's Sun Air airline will be named on April 29, a transport ministry spokeswoman said on Thursday.</p>
<p>She said the announcement was set for 1100 GMT at the offices of the department of public enterprises in Pretoria.</p>
<p>The announcement was originally due earlier this week but was postponed due to travel plans by Transport Minister Mac Maharaj.</p>
<p>-- Cape Town newsroom +2721 403-2502</p>
</text>
